{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-economy-measurement","title":"数字经济核算","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/digital-economy/governance-and-policy/digital-economy-measurement","wordCount":2105,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"数字经济核算\">数字经济核算</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><h3 id=\"数字经济核算的必要性与挑战\">数字经济核算的必要性与挑战</h3><p>&quot;如果不能测量它，就不能管理它。&quot;数字经济核算是政策制定和效果评估的基础性工作。然而，现行国民经济核算体系（SNA 2008）在设计时未充分考虑数字经济的特殊性，导致多个维度的测量偏差：</p>\n<p><strong>免费数字服务的价值遗漏</strong>：GDP仅记录市场交易价值，但数字经济中大量服务以零价格提供（搜索引擎、社交网络、导航）。消费者从这些服务中获得的效用（消费者剩余）不计入GDP：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>digital</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msubsup><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>P</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CS_{\\text{digital}} = \\int_0^{Q^*} P(Q) \\, dQ - P^* \\cdot Q^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">digital</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5592em;vertical-align:-0.9119em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6472em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8129em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7633em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9119em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9331em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>P</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P^* = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>digital</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msubsup><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CS_{\\text{digital}} = \\int_0^{Q^*} P(Q) \\, dQ</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">digital</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4481em;vertical-align:-0.3558em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.1945em;position:relative;top:-0.0006em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0922em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3442em;margin-left:-0.1945em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2579em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7633em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3558em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>，即全部面积均为消费者剩余，但GDP记录为零。</p>\n<p><strong>质量改进的测量困难</strong>：智能手机的计算能力在10年间增长了1000倍，但价格指数的质量调整方法（如Hedonic定价）可能未能充分反映这一进步，导致对价格下降的低估和对实际增长的低估。</p>\n<p><strong>平台中介服务的归类问题</strong>：网约车司机的收入应计入运输业还是信息服务业？电商平台GMV中平台服务费的增加值如何提取？</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;数字经济核算挑战&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;免费服务&lt;br/&gt;价值遗漏&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;质量改进&lt;br/&gt;测量偏差&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;平台经济&lt;br/&gt;归类困难&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;数据资产&lt;br/&gt;资本化缺失&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;GDP低估消费者福利&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;通胀高估/增长低估&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;产业边界模糊&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[&quot;投资和资产被低估&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"数字经济核算挑战\"] --&gt; B[\"免费服务&lt;br/&gt;价值遗漏\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"质量改进&lt;br/&gt;测量偏差\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"平台经济&lt;br/&gt;归类困难\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"数据资产&lt;br/&gt;资本化缺失\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"GDP低估消费者福利\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"通胀高估/增长低估\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"产业边界模糊\"]\n    E --&gt; E1[\"投资和资产被低估\"]</pre><h3 id=\"中国数字经济核算框架\">中国数字经济核算框架</h3><p>中国统计局2021年发布《数字经济及其核心产业统计分类（2021）》，建立了以下核算框架：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>数字经济增加值</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>数字产业化增加值</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>产业数字化增加值</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{数字经济增加值} = \\text{数字产业化增加值} + \\text{产业数字化增加值}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数字经济增加值</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数字产业化增加值</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">产业数字化增加值</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>数字产业化</strong>（核心产业）包含5大类：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>数字产品制造业（集成电路、通信设备、计算机等）</li>\n<li>数字产品服务业（数字产品批发零售、租赁等）</li>\n<li>数字技术应用业（软件开发、互联网服务、信息处理等）</li>\n<li>数字要素驱动业（互联网平台、数字金融等）</li>\n<li>数字化效率提升业（智慧农业、智能制造、数字商贸等）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>其中前4类为&quot;数字产业化&quot;（约占数字经济的20%），第5类为&quot;产业数字化&quot;（约占80%）。</p>\n<p>2025年核算结果：数字经济增加值约49万亿元，其中数字产业化约10万亿元，产业数字化约39万亿元，数字经济占GDP比重约35%。</p>\n<h3 id=\"oecd数字经济卫星账户\">OECD数字经济卫星账户</h3><p>OECD提出的数字经济卫星账户（Digital Economy Satellite Account）框架采用不同于中国的分层方法：</p>\n<p><strong>核心层</strong>（Core）：完全依赖数字技术才能存在的经济活动</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在线平台（搜索、社交、电商）</li>\n<li>数字中介服务</li>\n<li>共享经济数字层</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>窄义层</strong>（Narrow）：核心层 + 数字化使能产业</p>\n<ul>\n<li>IT和电信产业</li>\n<li>电子商务</li>\n<li>数字金融服务</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>广义层</strong>（Broad）：窄义层 + 所有使用数字技术的经济活动</p>\n<ul>\n<li>高度数字化的传统行业（数字制造、数字农业等）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>估算方法以供给-使用表（Supply-Use Table）为基础，通过增加&quot;数字&quot;行和列来追踪数字中间投入和产出。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数字gdp与消费者剩余测量\">数字GDP与消费者剩余测量</h3><p>Brynjolfsson等人（2019）提出的&quot;GDP-B&quot;概念试图将免费数字服务的消费者剩余纳入核算。方法论基于离散选择实验——询问用户&quot;愿意接受多少补偿才放弃使用某项数字服务&quot;（WTA方法）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>GDP-B</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>GDP</mtext><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><mi>W</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{GDP-B} = \\text{GDP} + \\sum_{j} WTA_j \\cdot N_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GDP-B</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GDP</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">WTA_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为服务 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 的中位数接受意愿，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为服务 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 的用户数。</p>\n<p>实验结果表明（美国数据）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>搜索引擎：中位WTA约$17,530/年</li>\n<li>电子邮件：中位WTA约$8,414/年</li>\n<li>地图导航：中位WTA约$3,648/年</li>\n<li>社交媒体：中位WTA约$322/年</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果纳入这些价值，美国GDP增速可能被低估约0.5个百分点/年。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数字劳动与平台就业统计\">数字劳动与平台就业统计</h3><p>数字经济催生了大量新型就业形态，对劳动统计提出挑战：</p>\n<p><strong>平台就业分类困境</strong>：外卖骑手、网约车司机、直播带货主播——他们是&quot;雇员&quot;还是&quot;独立承包商&quot;？分类影响社保覆盖、最低工资保护和工会权利。</p>\n<p><strong>零工经济规模测量</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>流量测量法：通过平台数据统计活跃劳动者数量</li>\n<li>存量测量法：通过劳动力调查统计以平台工作为主要/次要收入来源的人群</li>\n<li>两种方法给出的规模差异可达3-5倍</li>\n</ul>\n<p>中国2025年灵活就业人员约2亿人，其中依托互联网平台的约8400万人。这部分劳动力的收入、工作时长、社会保障覆盖等指标是数字经济核算的重要组成部分。</p>\n<p><strong>数字劳动的生产率测量</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Labor Productivity</mtext><mtext>platform</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mtext>Value Added</mtext><mtext>platform</mtext></msub><msub><mtext>Hours Worked</mtext><mtext>platform</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Labor Productivity}_{\\text{platform}} = \\frac{\\text{Value Added}_{\\text{platform}}}{\\text{Hours Worked}_{\\text{platform}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0747em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Labor Productivity</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">platform</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3435em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Hours Worked</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">platform</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Value Added</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">platform</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>难点在于：（1）灵活就业的工作时间难以精确界定（在线等待时间是否算工作时间？）；（2）多平台工作者的产出如何分配。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数据资产的资本化核算\">数据资产的资本化核算</h3><p>传统SNA将软件和数据库支出资本化（计入固定资本形成），但未将&quot;数据&quot;本身作为独立资产类别。随着数据被列为生产要素，数据资产核算成为前沿议题：</p>\n<p>需要回答的核心问题：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>数据的&quot;折旧&quot;如何计算？（数据不会物理磨损，但会时效性下降）</li>\n<li>数据的&quot;投资&quot;如何界定？（数据采集、清洗、标注的支出）</li>\n<li>数据资产的&quot;存量&quot;如何估值？（市场法、收益法、成本法）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>永续盘存法（Perpetual Inventory Method）应用于数据资产：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>K</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext>data</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mtext>data</mtext></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext>data</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_t^{\\text{data}} = (1-\\delta) \\cdot K_{t-1}^{\\text{data}} + I_t^{\\text{data}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1461em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">data</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2044em;vertical-align:-0.3053em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">data</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3053em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1461em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">data</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 为数据折旧率（反映数据的时效性衰减），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext>data</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_t^{\\text{data}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0961em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">data</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为当期数据投资（数据采集和加工支出）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2025-2026年数字经济核算领域取得重要进展。第一，联合国统计委员会正在推进SNA 2025修订，其中数字经济核算是核心议题之一，拟将数据作为独立资产类别纳入框架。</p>\n<p>第二，中国数据资产入表实施后，企业层面的数据资产核算实践快速积累。截至2025年底，已有超过200家企业完成数据资产入表，数据资产总规模超过500亿元。会计处理的标准化（无形资产 vs 存货）仍在探索中。</p>\n<p>第三，AI生成内容（AIGC）对核算的新挑战。当AI生成的代码、文本、图像进入生产流程，如何衡量AI的&quot;劳动&quot;贡献和产出价值？这可能需要重新定义&quot;生产边界&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>设计一个测量微信消费者剩余的离散选择实验。明确WTA问卷设计、样本选取方法和估算步骤。讨论该方法的潜在偏差（如假设性偏差、锚定效应）。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>使用中国统计年鉴数据，计算2020-2025年数字经济增加值占GDP比重的变化趋势。分析数字产业化和产业数字化各自的贡献率。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>讨论数据资产折旧率的确定方法。不同类型的数据（交易数据、行为数据、传感器数据）折旧率应当不同吗？设计一个基于数据预测精度衰减的折旧率估算方法。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某城市有50万外卖骑手、30万网约车司机、20万直播从业者。设计一个劳动力调查方案，准确测量平台就业者的工作时长、收入水平和社保覆盖率。讨论抽样方法和调查偏差。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>数字经济核算是连接数字经济理论与政策实践的桥梁。免费数字服务的价值测量、平台经济的产业分类、数据资产的资本化、数字劳动的统计——每一个维度都揭示了传统核算体系的局限性。掌握核算方法论不仅有助于理解宏观经济数据背后的真实含义，更是参与数字经济政策评估和制度设计的基本功。随着SNA 2025修订的推进，数字经济核算框架将迎来历史性更新。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数字经济核算","id":"数字经济核算"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"数字经济核算的必要性与挑战","id":"数字经济核算的必要性与挑战"},{"level":3,"text":"中国数字经济核算框架","id":"中国数字经济核算框架"},{"level":3,"text":"OECD数字经济卫星账户","id":"oecd数字经济卫星账户"},{"level":3,"text":"数字GDP与消费者剩余测量","id":"数字gdp与消费者剩余测量"},{"level":3,"text":"数字劳动与平台就业统计","id":"数字劳动与平台就业统计"},{"level":3,"text":"数据资产的资本化核算","id":"数据资产的资本化核算"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数字经济政策体系","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/digital-economy/governance-and-policy/digital-economy-policy"},"next":null}